## Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)
### How do I book a bus ticket on redBus?
- Visit the redBus website or mobile app, enter your departure and destination locations, select your travel date, choose a bus, select seats, and complete the payment process.

### Can I modify my booking?
- Modifications depend on the bus operator’s policies. You can modify bookings if allowed, via your redBus account.

### How can I track my bus?
- You can track your bus in real-time through the redBus platform once your booking is confirmed.

### What happens if my bus is delayed?
- redBus notifies users of any delays. Compensation may be provided depending on the bus operator’s policies.

### Can I cancel my bus ticket?
- Yes, you can cancel your ticket and request a refund as per the cancellation policy of the bus operator.

## Policies

### Cancellation and Refund Policy
- Cancellations can be made before the scheduled departure of the bus. The refund amount depends on the time of cancellation relative to the departure time.

### Privacy Policy
- redBus collects user data to provide services like booking tickets and sending notifications. User data is not shared with third parties without consent.

